Network Debug Utility

Runtime toolset: netshoot v0.16 (immutable manifest)

Start with:  net-report
Help:        net-debug --help
Tool list:   net-debug tools
Capture:      net-debug capture --help
Trace:        net-debug trace --help (host netns + BPF prerequisites)
Selected-pod capture: controller-approved ephemeral container only
Docs:        /usr/share/breakglass/runbooks/upstream/network-debug/README.md
Runbook:     /usr/share/breakglass/runbooks/upstream/network-debug/RUNBOOK.md
Optional:    /usr/share/breakglass/runbooks/internal/INDEX.md (read-only downstream bundle)

This container reports only the current network namespace. Do not paste
reports containing addresses or packet data into public issue trackers.
The optional downstream bundle is never sourced or executed by this image.
